t number of times:\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503. It makes at most 3 attempts in total and waits longer before each retry: 0.5s, then 1s.\n\n- **Settings:** two new constructor arguments, `max_attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`. Existing calls keep working unchanged.\n- **What gets retried:** only HTTP 503. Other HTTP errors and network errors are raised straight away, with no retry.\n- **When all attempts fail:** the last 503 error is raised to the caller.\n- **Cleanup:** each failed response is closed before the next attempt, so connections aren't left open.\n\nI tested it against a local server with the delay shortened to 0.05s:\n- No 503s: one request, data returned.\n- Two 503s: success on the third attempt, about 0.15s in total.\n- Three 503s: the 503 error is raised after 3 requests.\n- A 500: raised immediately after 1 request.\n\nThe repo has no test suite, so I didn't add any test files.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 34696, "requests_cache_write": 143473, "requests_cost_usd": 0.7563521999999999, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1600, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial25", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 109, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:51:55.085997+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 20.533, "t_checker_s": 1.883, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1612, "tokens_cache_rea